      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The post-concussion of the brain syndrome is an often observed clinical entity. In this especially subjective syndrome, one new pathogenic approach seems very interesting for the clinical and therapeutic conclusions. This is one medical case reported for the proof of this hypothesis."},
